WEBVTT

1
00:00:17.680 --> 00:00:20.761
evening Mateo made a special dinner to welcome his mother home.

2
00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:28.783
is delicious," Ally said between mouthfuls.

3
00:00:28.803 --> 00:00:30.603
"What do you call this dish?"

4
00:00:30.623 --> 00:00:33.361
"Chicken piccata," Mateo said.

5
00:00:33.381 --> 00:00:36.223
"It's Dawn's favorite," Ray said.

6
00:00:36.243 --> 00:00:39.425
"It was," Dawn corrected him.

7
00:00:39.445 --> 00:00:41.946
"I discovered a new favorite in the city.

8
00:00:42.327 --> 00:00:45.289
There's a Japanese restaurant that serves delicious sushi.

9
00:00:45.969 --> 00:00:47.270
I can't wait for you to try it!"

10
00:00:48.631 --> 00:00:53.174
Ray smiled politely and so did Mateo, but neither one looked as excited as Dawn.

11
00:00:53.194 --> 00:00:58.458
"It sounds like Dawn likes the city much better than Sandville," Ally thought.

12
00:00:58.478 --> 00:01:01.620
"I wonder if she even wants to be here."

13
00:01:02.332 --> 00:01:05.794
Ally tried to read Dawn's mind, but she couldn't get a clear signal.

14
00:01:07.976 --> 00:01:11.158
It was just like yesterday, when she'd tried to read Ray's thoughts.

15
00:01:12.699 --> 00:01:16.702
Maybe humans' thoughts were hard to read if they had lots of different feelings at once.

16
00:01:18.363 --> 00:01:22.566
The meal continued in silence, until at last, everyone had finished eating.

17
00:01:25.648 --> 00:01:28.870
Ally and Mateo got up to clear the table, but Ray stopped them.

18
00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:30.071
"We'll clean up.

19
00:01:30.571 --> 00:01:31.432
You kids can go."

20
00:01:32.244 --> 00:01:34.725
Relieved, Ally and Mateo went to her room.

21
00:01:34.745 --> 00:01:40.126
"That was a good meal," Ally said.

22
00:01:41.407 --> 00:01:42.707
But Mateo looked glum.

23
00:01:42.727 --> 00:01:47.628
"The chicken piccata was good, but now my mom likes sushi better.

24
00:01:48.689 --> 00:01:50.889
And I overheard her talking about moving to the city.

25
00:01:51.349 --> 00:01:51.930
For good!"

26
00:01:51.950 --> 00:01:54.830
"Oh no," Ally said.

27
00:01:54.850 --> 00:01:57.511
"Then you'd live far from her permanently."

28
00:01:57.531 --> 00:02:00.072
"Nope," Mateo said.

29
00:02:00.684 --> 00:02:03.526
"Because she wants Papi and me to move with her."

30
00:02:03.546 --> 00:02:06.167
"What?" Ally blinked.

31
00:02:06.187 --> 00:02:07.949
"But what about the diner?"

32
00:02:07.969 --> 00:02:11.291
"Papi doesn't want to sell it or move to the city.

33
00:02:11.811 --> 00:02:12.932
He loves Sandville."

34
00:02:14.052 --> 00:02:14.833
Mateo sighed.

35
00:02:15.673 --> 00:02:18.275
"He's so conflicted.

36
00:02:19.095 --> 00:02:20.296
I don't want to move either!"

37
00:02:21.617 --> 00:02:22.698
Ally jumped to her feet.

38
00:02:22.718 --> 00:02:26.480
"An Astralian's prime directive is to solve conflicts.

39
00:02:27.432 --> 00:02:31.795
I will be a good Astralian and convince Dawn that your family needs to stay here!"

40
00:02:31.815 --> 00:02:33.716
"That would be great!"

41
00:02:34.217 --> 00:02:35.358
Mateo looked relieved.

42
00:02:35.378 --> 00:02:37.039
"Thanks, Ally.

43
00:02:37.659 --> 00:02:38.720
Oh, and I almost forgot.

44
00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.741
I was on my space group chat earlier.

45
00:02:41.462 --> 00:02:44.324
People are saying that Lainie Polk might launch her P.O.D.

46
00:02:44.364 --> 00:02:45.704
from the Sandville desert."

47
00:02:46.625 --> 00:02:48.927
"Really?" Ally couldn't believe her luck.

48
00:02:49.987 --> 00:02:50.708
Mateo nodded.

49
00:02:50.728 --> 00:02:51.949
"And there's more.

50
00:02:52.529 --> 00:02:55.571
She might be planning to land on a planet called Carparia.

51
00:02:56.051 --> 00:02:56.672
Have you heard of it?"

52
00:02:57.660 --> 00:03:00.621
"Yes! Carparia is near Astralia!

53
00:03:02.902 --> 00:03:04.063
Or I think it is.

54
00:03:04.443 --> 00:03:06.124
I get it mixed up with Camparia."

55
00:03:07.024 --> 00:03:08.265
Ally switched Alpha on.

56
00:03:08.285 --> 00:03:15.067
"Alpha, which is closer to Astralia—Camparia or Carparia?"

57
00:03:15.087 --> 00:03:18.769
"Camping is popular with humans," Alpha said.

58
00:03:18.789 --> 00:03:21.530
"Ugh, not again!"

59
00:03:22.210 --> 00:03:22.791
Ally sighed.

60
00:03:22.811 --> 00:03:25.652
"Her glitches are getting worse."

61
00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.501
She turned off Alpha.

62
00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:56.181
"Either way, both planets are closer to Astralia than Earth is.

63
00:03:56.201 --> 00:03:58.062
If I can get to a nearby planet, I can use its technology to contact my parents.

64
00:03:58.082 --> 00:03:58.762
Then they can come and get me."

65
00:03:58.782 --> 00:04:00.022
"This could be your ticket home!"

66
00:04:00.042 --> 00:04:00.383
Mateo said.

67
00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:01.763
"We've got to find out if these rumors are true.

68
00:04:01.783 --> 00:04:03.104
I'll keep checking the chat for news."

69
00:04:03.124 --> 00:04:04.164
"Goood morning, Sandville!"

70
00:04:04.184 --> 00:04:04.745
a radio announcer said.

71
00:04:04.785 --> 00:04:06.485
"It's 79 degrees, and the sun is shining this fine morning!"

72
00:04:06.505 --> 00:04:07.006
"Turn that down, Alpha!"

73
00:04:07.026 --> 00:04:08.046
Ally covered her ears.

74
00:04:08.066 --> 00:04:10.507
"It's too early for the news.

75
00:04:10.867 --> 00:04:13.528
Play my morning dance music, please."

76
00:04:13.749 --> 00:04:15.389
But Alpha kept playing the news.

77
00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:21.372
"I wish I could get you to work like your old self," Ally said.

78
00:04:22.144 --> 00:04:28.129
She was about to turn Alpha off when the radio announcer said something else: Exciting things are happening

79
00:04:28.189 --> 00:04:29.230
in Sandville today!

80
00:04:29.670 --> 00:04:33.113
Several people have reported seeing large trucks parked in the desert.

81
00:04:33.413 --> 00:04:38.176
And a work crew is constructing something that can only be described as a spaceship.

82
00:04:38.737 --> 00:04:42.700
Is it possible that billionaire Lainie Polk will be launching her P.O.D.

83
00:04:42.740 --> 00:04:43.820
from the Sandville desert?

84
00:04:44.301 --> 00:04:47.443
Stay tuned to KSNV for more breaking news!

85
00:04:49.672 --> 00:04:52.534
Ally squealed with joy and raced toward Mateo's room.

86
00:04:53.755 --> 00:04:56.097
But Mateo was already on his way to her room.

87
00:04:56.117 --> 00:04:57.998
"Did you hear the news?"

88
00:04:58.418 --> 00:04:59.499
they both cried at once.

89
00:04:59.519 --> 00:05:01.941
"What's all the excitement about?"

90
00:05:02.381 --> 00:05:03.582
Ray called from the kitchen.

91
00:05:03.602 --> 00:05:05.463
"Nothing, Papi!"

92
00:05:05.904 --> 00:05:08.665
Mateo said as he and Ally ducked into her room.

93
00:05:08.685 --> 00:05:13.429
"We have to find a way to get you on that P.O.D.," Mateo said.

94
00:05:13.449 --> 00:05:14.930
"But how?"

95
00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:15.951
Ally asked.

96
00:05:15.971 --> 00:05:21.046
"I don't know, but we're not going to stop working on a plan until we get you a

97
00:05:21.106 --> 00:05:22.267
ride back to space!"

98
00:05:22.968 --> 00:05:23.708
Mateo vowed.

99
00:05:23.728 --> 00:05:26.810
"And we can start right now by—" "Hey, Ally!"

100
00:05:27.431 --> 00:05:28.852
Ray knocked lightly on the door.

101
00:05:28.872 --> 00:05:30.353
"I'll drive you to work today.

102
00:05:30.753 --> 00:05:31.834
We'll leave in 15 minutes."

103
00:05:32.935 --> 00:05:33.575
Ally groaned.

104
00:05:33.595 --> 00:05:36.017
"Oh well.

105
00:05:36.618 --> 00:05:38.999
I guess we'll start working on that plan later!"
